    rdfs:comment "VisionFlow is a GPU-accelerated, Rust-backed collaborative platform for real-time 3D knowledge graph visualisation and human-AI agent orchestration on private datasets, integrating Claude Flow MCP for spawning specialised agents. Junkie Jarvis refers to the integrated AI orchestration layer enabling multi-agent task delegation within the VisionFlow environment."@en ;
