    rdfs:comment "The upper bound on the number of tokens a model can ingest in a single forward pass, determined during training by the positional encoding scheme and available memory. It governs context retention, task complexity, and whether long inputs must be truncated, chunked, or processed with sliding-window attention."@en ;
