    rdfs:comment "Templates are reusable structural scaffolds in software engineering and knowledge management that define a fixed format or pattern into which variable content is inserted. They reduce repetition, enforce consistency, and accelerate authoring across code generation, documentation, and prompt engineering workflows."@en ;
