    rdfs:label "Generative AI Development Methodology"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A practitioner's phased methodology for building generative AI applications, progressing from proof-of-concept (using the best available models and rapid prototyping tools) through stakeholder validation to a robust production build, with explicit guidance on iterative evaluation, legal risk deferral, and avoidance of premature fine-tuning."@en ;
