    rdfs:label "Meta"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "An American technology company, formerly named Facebook, that operates social media platforms and develops virtual and augmented reality hardware and software. It rebranded to Meta Platforms in 2021 to reflect a focus on the metaverse."@en ;
