    rdfs:label "Open Webui and Pipelines"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Open WebUI (formerly Ollama WebUI, created by Tim Jaeryang Baek, first released October 2023, + GitHub stars by mid-2025) is a self-hosted, ChatGPT-equivalent web interface for interacting with local and remote Large Language Models through a polished conversational UI, supporting Ollama ..."@en ;
