    rdfs:comment "A formal process or credential that attests to the genuine origin, integrity, and provenance of a digital or physical artefact, typically employing cryptographic signing, trusted third-party attestation, or standards-based metadata embedding. Authenticity certification enables recipients to verify that content has not been altered and originated from a claimed source."@en ;
