    rdfs:label "Cross Platform Digital Twins"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Digital twin systems designed for interoperability across different software platforms and environments, enabling real-time data exchange, collaborative simulation, and unified virtual representations of physical assets or processes that can be accessed and manipulated from multiple compatible sy..."@en ;
