    rdfs:label "Open AI Chat Completions API"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The OpenAI Chat Completions API is a widely adopted HTTP interface for sending a sequence of role-tagged messages to a large language model and receiving a generated response. Its request and response schema, including roles, tool-calling, and streaming, has become a de facto interoperability standard implemented by many open-source and third-party inference servers. This compatibility lets applications swap model backends with minimal code change."@en ;
