    rdfs:comment "Search technology encompasses the algorithms, indexing systems, and retrieval mechanisms that enable efficient discovery of relevant information across structured and unstructured data sources. Modern search systems combine inverted indices, vector embeddings, and machine learning ranking models to support keyword, semantic, and hybrid queries at scale."@en ;
