    rdfs:comment "A peer-to-peer agent network where each node is identified by a DID Nostr Identity|did:nostr:<pubkey> DIDs and communicates via Nostr Relay|Nostr relays, enabling decentralised agent discovery, gossip, and work distribution without a centralised broker or coordinator, whilst respecting ea..."@en ;
