    rdfs:label "Three Dimensional Graphics"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Three Dimensional Graphics encompasses the computational techniques for modelling, transforming, and rendering three-dimensional geometry onto two-dimensional display surfaces, encompassing rasterisation, ray tracing, shading, and scene graph management. It underpins game engines, virtual and augmented reality platforms, digital twins, and scientific visualisation."@en ;
