    rdfs:comment "A cross-chain interoperability protocol that enables fast transfers and contract calls between Ethereum-compatible blockchains and Layer 2 networks without relying on a single trusted custodian, coordinating liquidity routers and a verification layer to achieve trust-minimised cross-chain composability."@en ;
