    rdfs:comment "GPTs and Custom Assistants are a family of user-configured task-specific applications built on top of foundation large language models in which a vendor exposes a no-code or low-code authoring surface that lets a user, an enterprise administrator, or a third-party developer compose a persistent a..."@en ;
