    rdfs:label "Harness Configuration Packs"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Skill packs, slash-command libraries, and meta-prompting frameworks that enhance existing coding agents with structured workflows, multi-role capabilities, and progressive disclosure — includes Superpowers, Everything Claude Code, GStack, Anthropic Skills, Get-Shit-Done (GSD), wshobson/agents, and pmstack."@en ;
