ngm:nist-post-quantum-cryptography a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "NIST Post-Quantum Cryptography"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A reference to NIST's programme and standards for cryptographic algorithms designed to resist attacks by quantum computers. It includes standardised key-establishment and digital signature schemes."@en ;
