    rdfs:comment "ComfyUI Client refers collectively to the suite of client-side interfaces, API layers, and software components that communicate with a running ComfyUI server—the open-source, node-based diffusion model inference engine created by comfyanonymous (GitHub user) and released in January 2023—enabling ..."@en ;
