ngm:credential-store a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Credential Store"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A credential store is the component within an identity system that holds user identifiers, secrets, and account attributes used during authentication. Implemented as a directory, database, or secrets vault, it is queried by an identity provider to validate sign-in attempts and issue tokens. Its integrity and confidentiality are critical to the security of the surrounding identity infrastructure."@en ;
