    rdfs:comment "Face Swap is the family of computer vision techniques that transfers the identity of a source face onto a target image, video frame, or live stream while preserving the target's pose, expression, illumination, occlusions, and surrounding scene context, formalised as the conditional generation pro..."@en ;
