    rdfs:comment "Model Based Control (MBC) is a class of control-system design paradigms in which an explicit mathematical model of the plant's dynamics — encoding kinematics, inertia tensors, contact forces, aerodynamics, or learned neural representations — is embedded within the controller to predict, plan, and..."@en ;
