    rdfs:comment "R3 Corda is a purpose-built permissioned distributed ledger platform designed exclusively for regulated financial services, implementing a \"need-to-know\" peer-to-peer architecture in which transaction data is shared solely amongst parties with legitimate business interest, eliminating global stat..."@en ;
