    rdfs:comment "Layer 3 (Bitcoin Layer 3) designates the application-layer stratum of the Bitcoin protocol stack — a collection of protocols, virtual machines, asset-issuance systems, and programmability frameworks constructed atop Layer 2 scaling networks (principally the Lightning Network and emerging"@en ;
