ngm:alerting a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Alerting"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Alerting is the observability capability that evaluates monitored signals against defined conditions and notifies responsible humans or automated systems when those conditions indicate a problem or an impending one. It converts continuous telemetry into discrete, actionable notifications routed to the appropriate on-call recipient. Effective alerting balances sensitivity against noise so that every alert is meaningful and timely."@en ;
