        ngm:peer-to-peer-network .

ngm:bitcoin-proof-of-work-protocol-etf a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Bitcoin ETF"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A Bitcoin ETF (Bitcoin Exchange-Traded Fund) is a regulated, exchange-listed pooled investment vehicle providing investors fungible share-based exposure to the spot price of Bitcoin (or, in the case of futures-based variants, to rolling CME Bitcoin futures contracts) through traditional broke..."@en ;
