    rdfs:label "Renewable Energy Certificates"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Digital or blockchain-tokenized instruments that certify the generation of one megawatt-hour (MWh) of electricity from renewable energy sources, providing transparent, immutable proof of renewable energy consumption for carbon accounting, sustainability reporting, and regulatory compliance, with ..."@en ;
