    rdfs:comment "Snapshot Voting is the dominant off-chain gasless governance infrastructure operated by Snapshot Labs that enables DecentralizedAutonomousOrganization|decentralised autonomous organisations and DeFi protocols to conduct binding-or-advisory governance polls without spending GasFees|gas..."@en ;
