    rdfs:comment "Novel view synthesis and 3D scene representation technique introduced by Kerbl, Kopanas, Leimkühler and Drettakis at SIGGRAPH 2023 (INRIA Sophia Antlis), representing scenes as explicit collections of s of anisotropic 3D Gaussian primitives — each defined by a 3D mean position μ ∈ ℝ³, a 3×3 covar..."@en ;
