ngm:data-lineage a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Data Lineage"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Data lineage is the documented record of data's origins, movements, transformations and consumption as it flows through systems and pipelines. It maps how a data element is derived end to end, supporting impact analysis, debugging, audit and regulatory compliance. As a pillar of data governance and metadata management it makes data trustworthy by exposing its provenance."@en ;
