    rdfs:comment "Real-time audio-visual communication technology enabling multiple geographically distributed participants to see and hear each other simultaneously through internet-connected devices, supporting face-to-face interaction across distances via compressed media streams, network protocols, and centralised or peer-to-peer media routing."@en ;
