    rdfs:comment "Blockchain Governance refers to the mechanisms, processes, and structures through which decisions are made about the development, operation, and evolution of blockchain networks and protocols, encompassing on-chain voting systems, decentralised autonomous organisations, and community-driven decision-making frameworks."@en ;
