    rdfs:comment "The property of an AI system whereby it produces equitable outcomes and avoids creating or reinforcing unjustifiable disparities across different demographic groups or individuals, measured through various mathematical definitions and ethical principles including demographic parity, equalized odds, equal opportunity, calibration, and individual fairness."@en ;
