    rdfs:comment "Cryptocurrency is a class of bearer-style digital assets whose unit ownership, issuance schedule, and transaction history are jointly secured by Public-Key Cryptography and a permissionless Consensus Mechanism operated by a Peer-to-Peer Network of independent nodes, such that no centr..."@en ;
