    rdfs:comment "Taxonomy category grouping decentralised finance protocols and blockchain-native economic mechanisms, including automated market makers, liquidity pools, yield farming, stablecoins, tokenisation, DAOs, and the incentive structures that govern on-chain economies."@en ;
