    rdfs:comment "Edge Computing is a distributed computing paradigm that relocates computation, storage, and intelligence from centralised hyperscale data centres towards the topological extremities of the network — into base stations, on-premises micro data centres, customer-premises gateways, vehicles, industri..."@en ;
